      "example_commands": ["SOURce:WLAN:SIGN:STATe ON", "SOURce:WLAN:SIGN:STATe OFF", "SOURce:WLAN:SIGN:STATe?"],
      "notes": "R&S WLAN signaling examples use SOUR:WLAN:SIGN1:STAT ON；SIGN 与 SIGN1 对实例 1 场景等价。"
